    "iOS 限制下,节奏唤醒采用本地通知 + HRV 自适应文案的方案。完整睡眠阶段感知需要 Apple Watch 后台,后续版本会接入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tempo Wakeup currently uses local notifications and HRV-aware guidance. Full sleep-stage sensing requires background Apple Watch support."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
