    "Tempo 不是医疗设备,不能替代专业医疗建议。如有不适请咨询医生。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tempo is not a medical device and is not a substitute for professional medical advice. Please consult your doctor if you feel unwell."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Tempo 会在闹钟前约 %lld 分钟先发一条温柔预热,主闹钟时再发一条。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tempo sends a gentle heads-up about %lld minutes before the main wake-up alert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tempo 内置 · 无需联网": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tempo built-in · No internet connection required"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Tempo 展示的是健康趋势和统计上下文,不用于疾病诊断。单次高压片段也可能受到运动、咖啡因或测量密度影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tempo shows health trends and statistical context, not medical diagnoses. A high-stress episode may also reflect exercise, caffeine, or measurement frequency."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Tempo 昵称": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tempo Nickname"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Tempo 独占": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tempo Only"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tempo 独占三件事": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3 Tempo-Only Things"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tempo 用 Apple Watch 监测你的心率、HRV 和压力,在合适的时机推荐节奏匹配的音乐、引导呼吸 — 让身体保持顺畅韵律。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tempo uses Apple Watch to monitor your heart rate, HRV and stress, recommend music with matching rhythm at the right time, and guide your breathing - keeping your body in a smooth rhythm."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Tempo 通过 Apple Health 读取你的睡眠分期。\n戴 Apple Watch 入睡几晚后会自动出现。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tempo reads sleep stages from Apple Health.\nWear Apple Watch to bed for a few nights to see insights here."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
