      }
    },
    "Apple HealthKit 主流只暴露 SDNN(5-10min 均值)。Apple Watch ECG App 手动录的 30s 数据,Tempo 用 Pan-Tompkins 简化算法检测 R 波,提取 RR 间期,算出 RMSSD/SDNN/pNN50 — 这是 Whoop / Oura 用的「真 HRV」指标。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple HealthKit mainstream only exposes SDNN (5-10min average). For 30 seconds of data manually recorded by the Apple Watch ECG App, Tempo uses the Pan-Tompkins simplified algorithm to detect the R wave, extract the RR interval, and calculate the RMSSD/SDNN/pNN50—this is the \"true HRV\" indicator used by Whoop/Oura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
