        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "During the call, both parties open Tempo and click here to \"Start SharePlay\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过 Tempo 共振 ID 跟家人 / 伴侣连接(无需通话)。对方压力上行或发来心跳时,你收到温柔提醒,可一键发预设鼓励语或自己写一句。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect with family/partners via Tempo Resonance ID (no calls required). When the other party's stress rises or sends a heartbeat message, you receive a gentle reminder and can send a preset encouragement message with one click or write one yourself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过本地网络同步呼吸节奏,适合伴侣 / 朋友放松。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
